Visual keyboard geometry was cross-checked against the official Air 01 photo
https://en.akkogear.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Air01-XGDB-GX-1.avif
and the vendor web configurator's Air01 geometry (js/8e84b96c.js). Coordinates,
physical legends and matrix associations are factual layout data. No vendor
photographs or artwork are distributed. Slot87's lighting action was confirmed
in a read-only device snapshot.

Terminal UI engine: Ratatui https://ratatui.rs/ (MIT); input: Crossterm (MIT).
The custom keyboard widget follows Ratatui's documented widget/mouse patterns.

Global LED parameters, mode numbers and checksum variants informed by sharkfin
app/src-tauri/src/protocol/mod.rs and app/src/lib/lighting-modes.ts at the above
revision. Air01-supported effect metadata checked against the vendor registry.

Air01-specific fixed/rainbow flags and indexed colors were confirmed directly
from the vendor class d8 in https://web.akkogear.com/js/b1d82b61.js, with the
shared serializer in https://web.akkogear.com/js/4abb36b7.js. No vendor source
is bundled. UI spacing and hierarchy were informed by Apple's public HIG:
https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/layout

Receiver relay research: sharkfin app/src-tauri/src/protocol/receiver.rs,
app/src-tauri/src/wire.rs and docs/PROTOCOL.md at the reference revision above.
Validated directly on Air01 receiver3151:5006; only device3013 is supported.
